@{ ViewData["Title"]="Customer Support"; }
<h1>Customer Support</h1>
<p>Support ticket workflow: create, assign, update status and review audit history. For protected API calls the logged-in user's authorized X-Company-Id and X-Branch-Id headers are required.</p>
<p>Endpoints: <code>GET /api/support/tickets</code>, <code>POST /api/support/tickets</code>, <code>PUT /api/support/tickets/{id}</code> and <code>GET /api/support/tickets/{id}/history</code>.</p>
<p>This page is an API handoff guide, not yet a fully operational ticket editor.</p>
